{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18508","headline":"题华十二判官汝州宅内亭 · 欧阳詹","name":"题华十二判官汝州宅内亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高居胜景谁能有，佳意幽情共可欢。\n新柳遶门青翡翠，修篁浮径碧琅玕。\n步兵阮籍空除屏，彭泽陶潜谩挂冠。\n只在城隍也趋府，岂如吾子道斯安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"欧阳詹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18508.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18508","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}